node_modules/
# The dependencies live in `.node_modules/` with a `node_modules` symlink —— this repository sits
# inside an Obsidian vault, and Obsidian excludes only folders starting with `.` from its note scan
# (before that, 653 .md files inside the dependencies were picked up as notes).
# `node_modules/` (with the slash) filters **neither a symlink nor a dot folder**, so both are stated.
.node_modules/
node_modules
main.js
dist/
dev-vault/
.DS_Store
*.log

# oh-my-claudecode session state — made by a tool, not source
.omc/
